WEBVTT

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:03.870
And there is no better medium
to do that dance than podcasting.

00:01:05.478 --> 00:01:10.010
On this first episode, my guest
is author Elizabeth Gilbert.

00:01:10.994 --> 00:01:14.071
Fifteen years ago, in response
to a personal crisis,

00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:16.950
she took a trip around the world
and wrote about it.

00:01:16.974 --> 00:01:21.747
And that book, "Eat Pray Love,"
became a global phenomenon,

00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:24.124
topping best-seller lists for years.

00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:26.469
In 2009, Liz came to the TED stage

00:01:26.493 --> 00:01:31.196
to talk about how hard it was
to follow that success with another book.